    "title": "Club tennis beats Temple in first 2025 tournament - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joseph Mancini ’28 ,\n1 days ago The St. Joe’s club tennis team experienced the full spectrum of tournament play in its first United States Tennis Association Middle States Sectionals tournament. Despite dropping the first two rounds against Drexel and Penn State, the team rallied and beat Temple club tennis with three wins in a strong team performance. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
